        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148627,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we call <code>health</code> and <code>score</code> in this object?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The object's properties</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The object's values</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The object's parameters</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The object's properties.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148628,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give the <code>player</code> object the property <code>lives</code> with value <code>3</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;lives&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lives\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>lives</code>, followed by <code>:</code>, and finally <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148629,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display the <code>health</code> property of the object.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"69\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>player.health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148630,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What will <code>console.log(enemy.type);</code> display?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hp\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.type = \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.type);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>goblin</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>slime</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"goblin\", \"slime\"]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>goblin slime</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>goblin</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148631,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In the following code, what does the line <code>npc.state = \"alert\";</code> do?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" npc = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"state\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"npc.state = \" /><text value=\"&quot;alert&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Changes the value of the object's <code>state</code> property from <code>\"idle\"</code> to <code>\"alert\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Creates a <strong>new</strong> property called <code>state</code> with value <code>\"alert\"</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sets the object's <code>state</code> property to the array <code>[\"idle\", \"alert\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Changes the value of the object's <code>state</code> property from <code>\"idle\"</code> to <code>\"alert\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148632,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assemble the code to create the object's method.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"method\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attack\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>attack</code> followed by <code>:</code> and then <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148633,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which code will tell a <code>player</code> object to run a method called <code>jump</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>player.jump();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>player.jump;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>player:jump();</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>player.jump();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148634,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the missing keyword so the method <code>isPaused</code> will <code>return</code> the value <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dungeon Run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isPaused\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148635,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which keyword do we use to refer to an object from within a method?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">the object name</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148636,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fill in the code so that the method <code>isAlive</code> will <code>return</code> the value of the property <code>alive</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alive\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isAlive\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".alive;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>this</code>, followed by <code>.</code>, and finally <code>alive</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148637,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What will the console output?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Forest&quot;, &quot;enemyCount&quot;: 30, &quot;boss&quot;: &quot;Ent&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelData = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(level);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelData.name);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Forest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Error</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"name\": \"Forest\", \"enemyCount\": 30, \"boss\": \"Ent\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Forest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148638,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stringify the <code>items</code> array to create a JSON.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parse\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"148\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items = [{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rarity\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;common&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"heal\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elixir&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rarity\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;rare&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"heal\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(items));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>JSON</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>stringify</code>, <code>items</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What will the console output?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;weapon&quot;: &quot;sword&quot;, &quot;damage&quot;: 11, &quot;durability&quot;: 90}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" newObject = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(jsonString);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(newObject.damage);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>11</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"11\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148640,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parse the following JSON object to access its <code>weapon</code> property.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;weapon&quot;: &quot;bow&quot;, &quot;damage&quot;: 5, &quot;durability&quot;: 48}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" obj = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(jsonString);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(obj.weapon);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>JSON.parse</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148641,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A JavaScript Object and a JSON Object are the same types of data.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">False. They are different data structures</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">True. They are the same and we can always use either</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">True, but JSON can only store booleans</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">False. They are different data structures.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
